It seems to me that it would be an enormous technical challenge to
implement pack changes on hallucinations.  There would be an extremely
large number of decisions to make.  As examples, what would you want to
have happen if you ate your sword or wore your food?  There are a bunch of
great possibilities in this, but putting it together in a consistent and
complete fashion would be a real chore.  It also stands a good chance of
screwing up the balance of the game, even if it were implemented well.
Suicide might not be a bad idea.

There are other extensions to the hallucination code which could be lots 
of fun.  How about virtual monsters and objects?  Try picking something 
up and **it's not there!**  Swoosh!  Your sword passes through the 
cockatrice!

